      "customfield_10050": "TC-PAY-001,TC-PAY-002",
      "description": "Implement a payment tokenization service that generates secure, irreversible tokens for cardholder PANs. The service must integrate with the HSM cluster for key management. Tokens stored in mfs_payments_db on pghost-prod-01.mfs.internal.\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n- Tokenization latency < 50ms p99\n- Support for PCI DSS v4.0 token format\n- Integrate with svc-token-vault service account\n- Deploy to mfs-pay-pod-01, mfs-pay-pod-02\n\nGitLab MR: !301\nChange Request: CHG0090101\nTest Cases: TC-PAY-001, TC-PAY-002",
